RULE 1 — Ek agent ek kaam
         Koi agent 2 cheezein nahi karega

RULE 2 — Har agent ka output typed hoga
         String nahi — TypedDict ya JSON

RULE 3 — Supervisor ke bina koi agent
         directly doosre ko call nahi karega

RULE 4 — Style profile hamesha
         Writer agent ko milegi

RULE 5 — Critic agent hamesha
         Writer se pehle chalega

RULE 6 — Cache mandatory hai
         ArXiv, Semantic Scholar queries

RULE 7 — Max tokens per agent:
         Research agents  → 500 tokens
         Writer agent     → 2000 tokens
         Other agents     → 300 tokens

RULE 8 — LLM or API model use karo
         Light agents ke liye
         Sonnet sirf Writer/Critic ke liye


Supervisor → Plan banaye

