├── ArXiv Agent    → "EM field levitation RL papers"
├── CS Agent       → Algorithm complexity nikale
├── RL Agent       → Reward function design kare
│                    State = field strength
│                    Action = current adjust
│                    Reward = object height
└── Gap Finder     → "RL + EM antigravity = novel!"

